==Battleground==
*2 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Zory]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Dagshund]]s spawn, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
**1 [[Zomboe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
If one is worried about needing a Zombie Killer for this stage, some Zombie Killers that can be used here that aren't useful anywhere else are [[Thief Cat (Rare Cat)|Goemon Cat]] (with [[Talents]]), [[Vengeful Cat (Rare Cat)|Kite Cat]], or miscellaneous collab units. Either way, this stage should not pose much of a problem.

